hits.howToPlayText:
On a mobile device:
- Character rotation - swipe from the right side of the screen;
- Character movement - virtual joystick on the left;
- Interact with items - tap the icon in the center of the screen;
- Menu navigation - tap the buttons.

On a desktop:
- Character rotation - mouse movement;
- Character movement - WASD keys;
- Interact with items - E key or left mouse button;
- Hint - H key;
- Inventory - TAB key.
